        <item>
            <title>1.4.4</title>
            <pubDate>Fri, 11 Sep 2026 12:42:19 -0400</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>13</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.4.4</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Vidmark 1.4.4

- Shows chapter and question activity, public agent updates, and separate staged and saved counts during app-started course builds.
- Adds a display-only progress tool for Codex, Claude, and in-app coordinators. Progress instructions remain locally customizable.
- Displays Claude's public live responses without exposing thinking or tool payloads.
- Keeps incomplete drafts distinct from successful saves, including after cancellation or validation errors.
]]></description>
